        "node_id": "n_10_d59d2f",
        "thought_text": "The current implementation using Kadane's algorithm with circular array modification is correct, but it can be simplified. Instead of using a two-pass approach, we can solve this problem with a single pass through the array, considering the circular nature of the schedule. This approach will correctly handle all cases, including the edge case where the maximum rest sequence wraps around the end of the array.",
