        "node_id": "n_8_fdc9bd",
        "thought_text": "The error in the previous implementation was that it didn't correctly handle the case where the longest rest period wraps around the end of the schedule to the beginning. The current approach of finding the minimum sum subarray in a doubled array doesn't work correctly for this problem. Instead, we should consider the circular nature by checking if the total number of resting hours is less than the total number of hours, and if so, we can add the length of the schedule to our result.",
